<div class="mandarin-hanzi">再见</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">zàijiàn</div>

''Meaning:'' goodbye; see you again  
''Part of speech:'' interjection

!! In context
老师，再见！ — Lǎoshī, zàijiàn! — Goodbye, teacher!

!! Usage note
A conventional farewell. When the next meeting is known, 明天见 (míngtiān jiàn, 'see you tomorrow') is a natural alternative.
